    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d738">

                <pb facs="0650" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/18392</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Garrett to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laredo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 12, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Three of Mexican band who crossed Rio Grande killed, six captured, horses
                    recovered and two Americans captured by them escaped. Four Japanese in band, one
                    of them captured.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
